-- A 5x5 layer of oil with two numerical aquifers and a producer in the
-- south-east corner (5,1).  The second layer is inactive and only holds the
-- aquifer cells.
--   Aquifer 1: three large cells on the west side (I- faces of I=1), starting
--              20 bar above the equilibrium pressure.
--   Aquifer 2: two small, tight cells on the north side (J+ faces of J=5),
--              at the equilibrium pressure, connected with TRANS_OPTION 1 and
--              a transmissibility multiplier of 0.5.

RUNSPEC

TITLE
COMPOSITIONAL NUMERICAL AQUIFERS ON TWO SIDES

